    "detailed_description": "<h1>Chuck's biggest concern!</h1><p>One day Chuck\u2019s wife gets kidnapped by a pterodactyl much to Chuck\u2019s delight. He\u2019s pretty happy at first but eventually gets hungry and quickly comes to appreciate his wife\u2019s cooking skills. He sets out to free his woman.<br><br>In Caveman Chuck you\u2019re taken back all the way to the Stone Age where you play the role of a crude caveman named Chuck. You\u2019ll quickly realize he shares his cave with his wife, who is heavily invested in the relationship, and as things often have it, she yells at him rather frequently.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Caveman Chuck is a classic 2D platformer inspired by the many favorites of the genre. You are taking a control over a caveman named Chuck who is fearless prehistoric warrior who.. lost his wife.. He need to overcome plains full of dangerous animals and traps, challenge even more dangerous bosses to bring her back home!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/f9c566fe03e234b426edce9296345359.poster.avif?t=1671022071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/f9c566fe03e234b426edce9296345359.webm?t=1671022071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/f9c566fe03e234b426edce9296345359.mp4?t=1671022071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Prehistoric bosses brings unique platformer-based experience! Challenge them to find Chuck's wife!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/b289458a641c8cfb7bd04e1464ded345.poster.avif?t=1671022071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/b289458a641c8cfb7bd04e1464ded345.webm?t=1671022071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/b289458a641c8cfb7bd04e1464ded345.mp4?t=1671022071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Start Chuck's journey and travel across sunny deserts, frozen wilds, dangerous jungles, and plains!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/1bde1995c8832cf1c264e7dc9ed1811b.poster.avif?t=1671022071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/1bde1995c8832cf1c264e7dc9ed1811b.webm?t=1671022071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/922650/extras/1bde1995c8832cf1c264e7dc9ed1811b.mp4?t=1671022071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enhance Chuck's power with bones found in-game!<br><br>",
